# Rendered videos. A render is a build artifact — reproducible from `video/`
# with one command — and git keeps every version of a binary forever, so a
# handful of re-renders is tens of megabytes of history nothing can reclaim.
# Render it, post it, keep the file outside the repo.
docs/video/

